        "Description": "Briefing:\r“Good morning, 47.\r\rYour targets are two militia commanders tied to Sean Rose. His removal appears to have activated a network of sleeper agents across Bangkok.\r\rThe group has already seized several areas… including sections of this hotel.\r\rThe hotel director has requested their immediate removal.\r\rEliminate the two leaders.\r\rAdditional militia members may be subdued… or eliminated… as you see fit.\r\rI’ll leave you to prepare.\r\rGood luck, 47.”",
